WEBVTT

01:49.919 --> 01:53.980
This was once the famous
city on the sea, Zaza.

01:54.490 --> 01:57.152
Every fall they hold a grand
festival, a masquerade ball.

01:57.627 --> 01:59.462
It is a town overflowing
with mystery.

01:59.462 --> 02:02.920
It is said to be quite a spectacle
to see everyone in their masks.

02:03.199 --> 02:04.791
Or at least that's
what is says here.

02:15.945 --> 02:19.904
How did we end up in this mess?!

02:24.120 --> 02:27.385
There has to be more
to the ball than this.

02:29.559 --> 02:32.161
If you guys are trying
to throw a good party,

02:32.161 --> 02:34.652
you're suffering from a lack
of decent looking women!

02:37.433 --> 02:39.468
Okay, get on up there!

02:39.468 --> 02:41.993
Madam Earl will not
stand for idiocy!

02:42.538 --> 02:44.836
You're the idiot here, old man.

02:45.274 --> 02:47.003
You'd better watch your mouth!

02:48.778 --> 02:52.942
Why must they be weighed
before they enter the ball?

02:53.516 --> 02:56.747
What's next? An eye examination?!

02:57.153 --> 03:00.056
What's the real reason for wearing
masks to this ball anyway?

03:00.056 --> 03:01.557
Is it so that we can overcome
prejudices people might have

03:01.557 --> 03:02.692
with the appearance
or age of others?

03:02.692 --> 03:04.717
So that everyone in the town can
become friends on equal ground?

03:04.961 --> 03:06.996
It's quite a loving and
liberating ideology!

03:06.996 --> 03:09.932
So why is it that none of you here

03:09.932 --> 03:13.424
look like you're remotely interested
in either friendship or love?

03:20.009 --> 03:24.275
Please be our friends! Please,
will you give us your love?!

03:24.680 --> 03:28.013
Sure, that sounds great. We
can start off as friends.

03:28.551 --> 03:30.678
We're so happy, we could just die!

03:46.802 --> 03:48.793
This should save you
a little time, right?

03:49.238 --> 03:50.830
Thank you.

03:51.574 --> 03:53.371
So where's the party?

03:54.043 --> 03:58.707
The Masquerade Ball of Zaza Part 1

04:15.031 --> 04:17.667
So where is this so-called
masquerade ball?

04:17.667 --> 04:21.626
Hey! Tell me! Do all you
guys like to dance?

04:21.871 --> 04:24.140
I'm sure all of you are
beautiful dancers!

04:24.140 --> 04:28.210
But this can't be the ball,
can it? I'm right, aren't I?

04:28.210 --> 04:31.577
Nope, this is a different
kind of masquerade ball.

04:34.183 --> 04:35.707
Mas Corrida?

04:37.853 --> 04:39.455
Shouldn't it say masquerade?

04:39.455 --> 04:41.650
I thought a masquerade
was a dance party.

04:41.957 --> 04:44.255
Isn't a corrida a ring
for bull fighting?

04:44.560 --> 04:48.394
It seems like they are sizing
us up for some kind of fight.

04:48.898 --> 04:53.267
So I guess this isn't one of your
more traditional masquerade balls?

04:54.337 --> 04:56.271
Ladies and gentleman,
thank you for waiting.

04:56.639 --> 04:59.073
I pleased to announce the beginning of
the long awaited masquerade ball

04:59.542 --> 05:02.978
that brings together the most
talented warriors in town.

05:02.978 --> 05:05.071
No, I'm sorry, the most talented
warriors of the entire world!

05:05.614 --> 05:07.316
I am sure that everyone
here has heard,

05:07.316 --> 05:09.511
but the champion of
this intense battle

05:09.752 --> 05:11.654
will receive the great
privilege of becoming

05:11.654 --> 05:13.713
the next heir to the
throne of all of Zaza!

05:14.490 --> 05:16.926
The purpose of this great
exhibition of warriors

05:16.926 --> 05:19.952
is to determine who will
replace Madame Earl Dubonnet!

05:36.412 --> 05:38.744
What's with that crazy mask up there?

05:39.215 --> 05:41.649
That Madame Earl is one cold bitch.

05:42.618 --> 05:44.245
Even through the mask,

05:44.487 --> 05:46.216
you can tell she always retains
that expressionless look.

05:46.455 --> 05:49.481
I've heard her face doesn't
even move when she speaks.

05:51.360 --> 05:54.625
That is why she changes into
masks with different expressions.

05:55.965 --> 05:58.627
Oh man, all of a sudden,
my face itches so bad!

05:59.068 --> 06:01.559
Now presenting, the young
lady next to the Madame Earl,

06:01.937 --> 06:03.905
the beautiful Miss Stir!

06:09.178 --> 06:10.780
Oh, she's so cute!

06:10.780 --> 06:13.613
I long to make her smile and give
her everything in the world!

06:16.752 --> 06:19.346
Now that we have welcomed
her Highness Madame Earl,

06:19.722 --> 06:22.850
the battle will now begin!

06:30.299 --> 06:31.766
Fight!

06:40.810 --> 06:42.402
Hey, here he comes.

06:44.413 --> 06:46.347
It looks like he gave
it his best shot.

06:51.220 --> 06:52.812
Looks like he fought hard too, Kir.

07:01.096 --> 07:03.724
Whoever that is, he's
defeating everyone.

07:04.300 --> 07:07.030
This is normal for the masquerade ball.

07:07.636 --> 07:10.571
No one ever wins this damn thing!

07:17.246 --> 07:18.681
Ever since Madame
Dubonnet's only son died,

07:18.681 --> 07:20.706
she has been holding these balls
to find a warrior to replace him.

07:21.150 --> 07:25.246
It doesn't matter how many fights
you win, or how strong you are.

07:28.457 --> 07:33.156
That cruel-hearted Madame Earl
will never decide on anyone.

07:34.396 --> 07:37.126
It sort of makes it hard to take
this thing seriously anymore.

07:38.868 --> 07:42.099
She doesn't care who
wins, or who loses.

07:42.471 --> 07:44.803
At the end of the day, everyone is
thrown out together with the trash.

07:46.141 --> 07:48.344
But there are the three Ice Brothers

07:48.344 --> 07:50.835
who serve the House of the
Earl, Baffle, Crash, and Cube.

07:51.480 --> 07:55.416
They always end up killing everyone
who becomes a possible champion.

07:59.021 --> 08:01.190
It is like she is a disease that
has poisoned the entire town.

08:01.190 --> 08:03.624
That is why she always wears a
mask in front of the people.

08:04.593 --> 08:10.498
But that is not the only
mask that she wears.

08:11.867 --> 08:15.098
This battle is the biggest joke yet.
This is how it goes.

08:16.205 --> 08:17.729
The loser loses,

08:18.507 --> 08:20.168
and the winner loses too.

08:21.410 --> 08:24.436
It's useless. The only one who
ever wins here is the Madame.

08:28.183 --> 08:30.174
You're up next, kid. Get ready.

08:32.221 --> 08:36.783
Next up, we have one of the favorite
seeds for the championship title!

08:38.994 --> 08:39.929
Go get 'em!

08:39.929 --> 08:40.863
Hey, Danda!
Go get 'em!

08:40.863 --> 08:41.530
Hey, Danda!

08:41.530 --> 08:42.264
Look over here!

08:42.264 --> 08:43.032
Hey, Danda!
Look over here!

08:43.032 --> 08:43.862
Hey, Danda!

08:48.070 --> 08:50.172
I don't think I'll ever understand
the way little, human kids

08:50.172 --> 08:53.073
can fall so passionately in love
based solely on looks alone!

09:00.349 --> 09:01.839
Fight!

09:02.084 --> 09:04.687
The fight of the
hour has just begun!

09:04.687 --> 09:07.423
Everyone's favorite in this fight
has got to be Maltick Danda,

09:07.423 --> 09:11.223
one of the best
warriors in all of Zaza!

09:11.860 --> 09:15.230
Danda is the best bull fighter
we've got here in town.

09:15.230 --> 09:17.130
We should all consider ourselves
privileged to watch him fight.

09:17.366 --> 09:20.502
He says his wolf claw makes
him an artist of death,

09:20.502 --> 09:22.561
who makes meals of his opponents!

09:24.273 --> 09:26.108
It doesn't look like this little
runt will stand much of a chance.

09:26.108 --> 09:29.805
Especially with no weapon,
he's fighting barehanded!

09:30.379 --> 09:33.246
Danda may already be tired, but
I don't think it matters much.

09:34.416 --> 09:37.753
He should make quick
work of this kid,

09:37.753 --> 09:42.622
and cook him up faster than a
hamburger patty on the grill.

09:48.297 --> 09:50.065
He dodged it!

09:50.065 --> 09:52.898
His trademark left wolf claw!
No one has ever dodged it!

09:54.770 --> 09:58.604
Hey, kid, you're the first
one to ever dodge that attack.

09:59.341 --> 10:02.174
Oh, really? I guess this will
also be your first time to lose.

10:09.551 --> 10:11.018
He dodged that one too!

10:24.133 --> 10:26.363
That was nice. You blow
really nice kisses.

10:32.374 --> 10:34.137
You little...

10:34.576 --> 10:37.511
So what's next? Aren't you even
going to buy me dinner first?

10:37.980 --> 10:40.005
He'd better drop that thing.

10:40.549 --> 10:42.885
Excuse me, Miss, be careful!

10:42.885 --> 10:44.352
Leave me alone!

10:56.865 --> 11:02.667
Yatonokami! He is using
the yatonokami attack!

11:03.038 --> 11:05.370
This is turning into quite
a fun fight, thank you!

11:06.608 --> 11:08.911
This little move should
shut that mouth of yours up!

11:08.911 --> 11:10.776
Looks like I got a
new toy to play with!

11:20.489 --> 11:22.457
If I were you, I'd check my armor.

11:22.758 --> 11:24.919
I think you've got a
new vulnerable spot.

11:47.583 --> 11:50.586
Of course, no man can continue
a fight without his butt armor!

11:50.586 --> 11:54.386
That would be pretty risquй,
even for a lady-killer like him!

12:08.804 --> 12:10.105
Madame, are you all right?

12:10.105 --> 12:10.305
Calm down, she's fine.
You saw what happened!
Madame, are you all right?

12:10.305 --> 12:12.830
Calm down, she's fine.
You saw what happened!

12:15.944 --> 12:19.436
"I will get your Vintage Smile.
- Signed, The Bandit King"

12:19.982 --> 12:21.449
Oh, I'm such a bad boy!

12:36.999 --> 12:38.523
The Vintage Smile?!

12:39.034 --> 12:42.003
Is that our famous, special
mask made of pearl?

12:42.437 --> 12:48.277
The same mask that is to be
presented to the Madame's heir?

12:48.277 --> 12:50.040
Is he talking about that
same Vintage Smile?!

12:50.579 --> 12:52.410
Get a hold of yourself, Angostura!

12:52.915 --> 12:54.583
Okay...

12:54.583 --> 12:56.385
He's after a family heirloom!

12:56.385 --> 12:59.218
Quick! Surround the mask vault
and protect it! Hurry up!

12:59.721 --> 13:02.057
Angostura? Do we have
a thief on our hands?

13:02.057 --> 13:03.158
Yes, Sir!

13:03.158 --> 13:03.559
So he's after the Vintage Smile?
Yes, Sir!

13:03.559 --> 13:04.753
So he's after the Vintage Smile?

13:05.160 --> 13:07.628
Who does that bandit think he is?!

13:07.863 --> 13:09.888
Mother, this is all happening

13:10.632 --> 13:13.726
because you still haven't found a
suitable replacement for Lemon!

13:14.403 --> 13:16.428
Miss, there's no need for that.

13:16.705 --> 13:19.765
We need to get guards
posted right away!

13:21.677 --> 13:24.305
We cannot allow anyone to
desecrate the sacred mask!

13:24.947 --> 13:28.110
From what we've already seen, I
can tell he is a master thief.

13:28.817 --> 13:31.581
I'm sure he is the most heinous
thief this town has ever seen!

13:32.187 --> 13:35.418
We must get the guards in place
to protect us from this devil!

13:37.259 --> 13:39.420
A demon! A devil!

13:39.862 --> 13:43.889
I told you not to eat that cherry, Jing!

13:44.266 --> 13:45.634
Really?

13:45.634 --> 13:47.636
Right now, I'm more worried about

13:47.636 --> 13:50.605
how we're going to steal
the Vintage Smile.

13:51.039 --> 13:53.599
Hey, Kir!

13:57.012 --> 13:58.479
Welcome...

14:04.953 --> 14:07.183
Welcome, please follow me.

14:07.789 --> 14:11.725
She's gone, my true love,
where could she be?

14:12.294 --> 14:13.761
Over here?!

14:14.997 --> 14:18.023
What the?! Who's bothering
me at a time like this?

14:21.904 --> 14:25.203
You again! You little brat!

14:25.674 --> 14:27.910
This time around you won't
have a ref to stop me.

14:27.910 --> 14:31.505
The only thing you'll have is
a brand new tombstone!

14:37.386 --> 14:39.946
I'd have thought you would have had
enough of showing everyone your ass,

14:40.489 --> 14:42.184
but this is the second time today.

14:43.792 --> 14:45.259
Baffle...

14:46.428 --> 14:49.454
Hey kid, you feel like meeting
the same fate as this guy!

14:50.432 --> 14:52.401
This is a special place

14:52.401 --> 14:55.131
where friends of the Madame come
to have a little taste of paradise.

14:55.604 --> 14:58.774
It is an important place
for Her Highness,

14:58.774 --> 15:00.742
and outsider scum like
you don't belong.

15:00.742 --> 15:03.939
You can either get out, or stay here
and we'll turn you into mincemeat!

15:04.880 --> 15:07.110
Your flowers will never
bloom if you're dead kid!

15:07.683 --> 15:09.981
Oh, really? I'll leave my
seeds with you then.

15:12.287 --> 15:14.881
Hey, now are you glad
I ate that cherry?

15:15.324 --> 15:16.985
You little...

15:17.225 --> 15:18.783
You won't be laughing when
I cut out your throat.

15:21.129 --> 15:22.653
You can't hide behind there forever!

15:23.265 --> 15:25.233
Don't worry, he'll keep
me safe for a while.

15:55.297 --> 15:57.731
Nothing here but a monkey
and a little chicken.

15:58.467 --> 16:00.526
I think I'll eat both of you in
a sandwich for lunch.

16:13.081 --> 16:14.708
Kir Royale!

16:19.721 --> 16:21.189
What's wrong, Kir?!

16:21.189 --> 16:24.488
It's from when he grabbed my neck.

16:24.993 --> 16:26.517
I can't...

16:34.336 --> 16:36.167
What do you think you're doing?!

16:36.538 --> 16:39.234
Can't aim right?! You're not
going to hit anything like that!

16:39.908 --> 16:41.535
What's going on? The
ground is shaking.

16:45.280 --> 16:49.046
This is one kid who will never
have a chance to be the champ.

16:49.918 --> 16:51.385
What's going on?!

16:52.054 --> 16:53.578
What's happening?

16:54.089 --> 16:56.625
This town is held up by many pillars,

16:56.625 --> 16:58.183
and now they're all shaking.

16:58.760 --> 17:01.558
I guess underneath us is
all just empty space.

17:02.831 --> 17:04.298
So you had better...

17:05.033 --> 17:06.500
Watch your step!

17:25.187 --> 17:26.654
Stop right there!

17:31.693 --> 17:34.753
Angostura Sr., but he's...

17:35.464 --> 17:40.697
If you move one more inch,
I'll have both of your heads.

17:41.570 --> 17:43.128
Kid, you're coming with me.

17:58.186 --> 18:00.518
What kind of town is this anyway?

18:02.124 --> 18:06.493
Hey, Postino, you're not going
to wear a carnival mask?

18:06.862 --> 18:09.831
I can't Jing. It is my job to not
discriminate and deliver letters

18:09.831 --> 18:12.766
to everyone equally, regardless of
whether they have a mask or not.

18:16.638 --> 18:20.199
Hey, Jing, I guess that guy, Ginjou,
was right about everything.

18:20.575 --> 18:23.976
That Madame is like a god here
and controls everything.

18:24.513 --> 18:26.208
You guys know nothing!

18:26.848 --> 18:28.884
The Madame has shed many
tears for this town of ours,

18:28.884 --> 18:30.647
and given us everything we have.

18:30.919 --> 18:32.910
Don't pretend you don't know
what's going on here!

18:34.189 --> 18:36.521
I don't, but why does she cry?

18:37.025 --> 18:41.394
The Madame has already shed
a lifetime's worth of tears.

18:50.505 --> 18:52.302
Eight years ago,

18:52.908 --> 18:57.845
the seemingly endless years
of war were finally over.

18:58.647 --> 19:01.516
Peace was finally restored to Zaza

19:01.516 --> 19:05.953
and our benevolent Earl
Dubonnet was returning home.

19:06.555 --> 19:11.993
In the meantime, Madame
Earl received a message

19:12.661 --> 19:15.152
that reported of the
Earl's death in battle.

19:15.764 --> 19:19.825
But the Madame had no
time to shed her tears.

19:20.068 --> 19:22.764
The devil had already finished
his plans for the next tragedy.

19:23.572 --> 19:26.598
Their son, Lemon, was assassinated.

19:27.142 --> 19:29.303
He was only three years
old at the time.

19:29.945 --> 19:33.005
The killer was his very own uncle.

19:33.682 --> 19:35.984
There was a huge conspiracy
among their family,

19:35.984 --> 19:37.786
and his uncle assassinated Lemon

19:37.786 --> 19:39.378
to assure that he would become
the heir to the throne.

19:40.689 --> 19:45.149
The Madame lost her beloved husband
and son, whom she loved so much,

19:47.596 --> 19:53.796
and I have not left her side since
that unfortunate night.

19:55.437 --> 20:00.966
Why, why do men have to
love war and battle so?

20:01.943 --> 20:03.410
If you love it so much...

20:04.212 --> 20:06.874
I too must fight.
Fight until the end!

20:09.618 --> 20:13.888
I too must fight, for all time!

20:13.888 --> 20:18.154
Ever since then, she has
been prepared for battle.

20:18.426 --> 20:20.629
She continues to fight in hopes
of filling the void in her heart

20:20.629 --> 20:22.893
that was caused by
the murder of her son.

20:28.536 --> 20:31.506
Hey, what the hell is he doing?

20:31.506 --> 20:33.030
What should we do?

20:33.341 --> 20:36.833
Well now, are we all in store
for another big surprise?!

20:37.078 --> 20:38.647
This is one of the three
Ice Brothers, Cube de Ice,

20:38.647 --> 20:40.215
otherwise known as
the Carpenter of Hell!

20:40.215 --> 20:43.844
This will definitely be one of
the best fights of the year!

20:44.452 --> 20:49.617
Cube! You had better not lose this
battle and defame our family name!

21:22.490 --> 21:26.221
Hey, why is everyone so
quiet all of a sudden?
